{"logId": "79d2ad4e-3a32-454d-8d7a-9a9e54c26c36", "result": {"layoutParsingResults": [{"prunedResult": {"page_count": null, "width": 1190, "height": 1684, "model_settings": {"use_doc_preprocessor": false, "use_layout_detection": true, "use_chart_recognition": false, "use_seal_recognition": false, "use_ocr_for_image_block": false, "format_block_content": false, "merge_layout_blocks": true, "markdown_ignore_labels": ["number", "footnote", "header", "header_image", "footer", "footer_image", "aside_text"], "return_layout_polygon_points": true}, "parsing_res_list": [{"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "阳光——", "block_bbox": [202, 141, 298, 166], "block_id": 0, "block_order": 1, "group_id": 0, "block_polygon_points": [[202.0, 141.0], [298.0, 141.0], [298.0, 166.0], [202.0, 166.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "活出人性善良、美好的一面。", "block_bbox": [204, 182, 434, 205], "block_id": 1, "block_order": 2, "group_id": 1, "block_polygon_points": [[204.0, 182.0], [434.0, 182.0], [434.0, 205.0], [204.0, 205.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "勇敢——", "block_bbox": [203, 232, 297, 256], "block_id": 2, "block_order": 3, "group_id": 2, "block_polygon_points": [[203.0, 232.0], [296.0, 232.0], [296.0, 255.0], [203.0, 255.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "心底坦荡、正直、强烈的正义感，敢于面对、接受、敢于主动承担、有解决问题的信心和决心，为了善良和信念无谓生死，永不退缩！", "block_bbox": [166, 273, 1017, 326], "block_id": 3, "block_order": 4, "group_id": 3, "block_polygon_points": [[166.0, 273.0], [1017.0, 273.0], [1017.0, 326.0], [166.0, 326.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "正义---", "block_bbox": [202, 353, 298, 376], "block_id": 4, "block_order": 5, "group_id": 4, "block_polygon_points": [[202.0, 353.0], [297.0, 353.0], [297.0, 375.0], [202.0, 375.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "传播和保护正能量，控制自己的邪恶，或在保护好自己的基础上，合理阻止他人的邪恶。从制度上保证每个人的人格、权益、尊严得到保护，不受伤害。", "block_bbox": [164, 394, 1018, 447], "block_id": 5, "block_order": 6, "group_id": 5, "block_polygon_points": [[164.0, 394.0], [1018.0, 394.0], [1018.0, 447.0], [164.0, 447.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "博爱——", "block_bbox": [202, 475, 299, 500], "block_id": 6, "block_order": 7, "group_id": 6, "block_polygon_points": [[202.0, 475.0], [299.0, 475.0], [299.0, 500.0], [202.0, 500.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "基于平等与自由意志的普世价值，对自己、他人以及万事万物的生命，源于纯粹心灵无私、广泛、没有束缚的爱！博爱是在成熟文明的社会环境中每个公民应具备的基本品质。", "block_bbox": [163, 517, 1018, 569], "block_id": 7, "block_order": 8, "group_id": 7, "block_polygon_points": [[163.0, 517.0], [1018.0, 517.0], [1018.0, 569.0], [163.0, 569.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "节制——", "block_bbox": [203, 601, 299, 625], "block_id": 8, "block_order": 9, "group_id": 8, "block_polygon_points": [[203.0, 601.0], [298.0, 601.0], [298.0, 624.0], [203.0, 624.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "保持理性，任何事都在健康合理的度以内调整。", "block_bbox": [203, 640, 577, 664], "block_id": 9, "block_order": 10, "group_id": 9, "block_polygon_points": [[203.0, 640.0], [577.0, 640.0], [577.0, 664.0], [203.0, 664.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "[08]", "block_bbox": [574, 717, 611, 738], "block_id": 10, "block_order": 11, "group_id": 10, "block_polygon_points": [[574.0, 717.0], [610.0, 717.0], [610.0, 737.0], [574.0, 737.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "戒恶：虚伪、无知、自私、自卑、贪婪、嫉妒、束缚、伤害", "block_bbox": [201, 901, 813, 928], "block_id": 11, "block_order": 12, "group_id": 11, "block_polygon_points": [[201.0, 901.0], [813.0, 901.0], [813.0, 928.0], [201.0, 928.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "恶——", "block_bbox": [239, 957, 312, 980], "block_id": 12, "block_order": 13, "group_id": 12, "block_polygon_points": [[239.0, 957.0], [311.0, 957.0], [311.0, 979.0], [239.0, 979.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "指人性中丑陋的、黑暗的一面，也包括由于奴性文化形成的让人们痛苦的、苦悲的诸多因素。", "block_bbox": [237, 995, 970, 1020], "block_id": 13, "block_order": 14, "group_id": 13, "block_polygon_points": [[237.0, 995.0], [970.0, 995.0], [970.0, 1020.0], [237.0, 1020.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "戒恶——", "block_bbox": [239, 1052, 333, 1076], "block_id": 14, "block_order": 15, "group_id": 14, "block_polygon_points": [[239.0, 1052.0], [332.0, 1052.0], [332.0, 1075.0], [239.0, 1075.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "认知人性及奴性在生命中形成的无知、愚昧、迷失自我等的不成熟状态。懂得摒弃“恶”的习惯，理性、勇敢地接受并弱化或改变。对于本性的特质，做到清醒的自我认知和有效的节制，把“恶”管控在一定的范围内，尽量规避或最大化地降低对彼此造成的伤害或痛苦！与此同时，朝着“善”的一面发展，培养健全的人格，成就阳光个性的生命。", "block_bbox": [200, 1092, 1054, 1205], "block_id": 15, "block_order": 16, "group_id": 15, "block_polygon_points": [[200.0, 1092.0], [1054.0, 1092.0], [1054.0, 1205.0], [200.0, 1205.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "虚伪——", "block_bbox": [239, 1234, 335, 1258], "block_id": 16, "block_order": 17, "group_id": 16, "block_polygon_points": [[239.0, 1234.0], [334.0, 1234.0], [334.0, 1257.0], [239.0, 1257.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "假的、不真实的、不真诚的，让人不信任的、让人痛苦的。", "block_bbox": [238, 1275, 702, 1297], "block_id": 17, "block_order": 18, "group_id": 17, "block_polygon_points": [[238.0, 1275.0], [702.0, 1275.0], [702.0, 1297.0], [238.0, 1297.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "无知——", "block_bbox": [239, 1330, 333, 1354], "block_id": 18, "block_order": 19, "group_id": 18, "block_polygon_points": [[239.0, 1330.0], [332.0, 1330.0], [332.0, 1353.0], [239.0, 1353.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "不善于思考、认知事物太局限、太狭隘，停留在自我的固定思维意识当中、缺乏开放性思维和不断学习的意识，形成自以为是、固执、骄傲或自怨自艾的状态。", "block_bbox": [201, 1369, 1053, 1422], "block_id": 19, "block_order": 20, "group_id": 19, "block_polygon_points": [[201.0, 1369.0], [1053.0, 1369.0], [1053.0, 1422.0], [201.0, 1422.0]]}, {"block_label": "number", "block_content": "[09]", "block_bbox": [612, 1478, 649, 1497], "block_id": 20, "block_order": null, "group_id": 20, "block_polygon_points": [[612.0, 1478.0], [648.0, 1478.0], [648.0, 1496.0], [612.0, 1496.0]]}], "layout_det_res": {"boxes": [{"cls_id": 17, "label": "paragraph_title", "score": 0.5601518750190735, "coordinate": [202, 141, 298, 166], "order": 1, "polygon_points": [[202.0, 141.0], [298.0, 141.0], [298.0, 166.0], [202.0, 166.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.7888588309288025, "coordinate": [204, 182, 434, 205], "order": 2, "polygon_points": [[204.0, 182.0], [434.0, 182.0], [434.0, 205.0], [204.0, 205.0]]}, {"cls_id": 17, "label": "paragraph_title", "score": 0.7723289728164673, "coordinate": [203, 232, 297, 256], "order": 3, "polygon_points": [[203.0, 232.0], [296.0, 232.0], [296.0, 255.0], [203.0, 255.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8998668193817139, "coordinate": [166, 273, 1017, 326], "order": 4, "polygon_points": [[166.0, 273.0], [1017.0, 273.0], [1017.0, 326.0], [166.0, 326.0]]}, {"cls_id": 17, "label": "paragraph_title", "score": 0.7100810408592224, "coordinate": [202, 353, 298, 376], "order": 5, "polygon_points": [[202.0, 353.0], [297.0, 353.0], [297.0, 375.0], [202.0, 375.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8935332298278809, "coordinate": [164, 394, 1018, 447], "order": 6, "polygon_points": [[164.0, 394.0], [1018.0, 394.0], [1018.0, 447.0], [164.0, 447.0]]}, {"cls_id": 17, "label": "paragraph_title", "score": 0.7523607015609741, "coordinate": [202, 475, 299, 500], "order": 7, "polygon_points": [[202.0, 475.0], [299.0, 475.0], [299.0, 500.0], [202.0, 500.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8999391198158264, "coordinate": [163, 517, 1018, 569], "order": 8, "polygon_points": [[163.0, 517.0], [1018.0, 517.0], [1018.0, 569.0], [163.0, 569.0]]}, {"cls_id": 17, "label": "paragraph_title", "score": 0.7902682423591614, "coordinate": [203, 601, 299, 625], "order": 9, "polygon_points": [[203.0, 601.0], [298.0, 601.0], [298.0, 624.0], [203.0, 624.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8122909069061279, "coordinate": [203, 640, 577, 664], "order": 10, "polygon_points": [[203.0, 640.0], [577.0, 640.0], [577.0, 664.0], [203.0, 664.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.647703230381012, "coordinate": [574, 717, 611, 738], "order": 11, "polygon_points": [[574.0, 717.0], [610.0, 717.0], [610.0, 737.0], [574.0, 737.0]]}, {"cls_id": 17, "label": "paragraph_title", "score": 0.8616019487380981, "coordinate": [201, 901, 813, 928], "order": 12, "polygon_points": [[201.0, 901.0], [813.0, 901.0], [813.0, 928.0], [201.0, 928.0]]}, {"cls_id": 17, "label": "paragraph_title", "score": 0.5871223211288452, "coordinate": [239, 957, 312, 980], "order": 13, "polygon_points": [[239.0, 957.0], [311.0, 957.0], [311.0, 979.0], [239.0, 979.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.816163957118988, "coordinate": [237, 995, 970, 1020], "order": 14, "polygon_points": [[237.0, 995.0], [970.0, 995.0], [970.0, 1020.0], [237.0, 1020.0]]}, {"cls_id": 17, "label": "paragraph_title", "score": 0.7419342398643494, "coordinate": [239, 1052, 333, 1076], "order": 15, "polygon_points": [[239.0, 1052.0], [332.0, 1052.0], [332.0, 1075.0], [239.0, 1075.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.9481232762336731, "coordinate": [200, 1092, 1054, 1205], "order": 16, "polygon_points": [[200.0, 1092.0], [1054.0, 1092.0], [1054.0, 1205.0], [200.0, 1205.0]]}, {"cls_id": 17, "label": "paragraph_title", "score": 0.7735199928283691, "coordinate": [239, 1234, 335, 1258], "order": 17, "polygon_points": [[239.0, 1234.0], [334.0, 1234.0], [334.0, 1257.0], [239.0, 1257.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8260537981987, "coordinate": [238, 1275, 702, 1297], "order": 18, "polygon_points": [[238.0, 1275.0], [702.0, 1275.0], [702.0, 1297.0], [238.0, 1297.0]]}, {"cls_id": 17, "label": "paragraph_title", "score": 0.7057311534881592, "coordinate": [239, 1330, 333, 1354], "order": 19, "polygon_points": [[239.0, 1330.0], [332.0, 1330.0], [332.0, 1353.0], [239.0, 1353.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.906800389289856, "coordinate": [201, 1369, 1053, 1422], "order": 20, "polygon_points": [[201.0, 1369.0], [1053.0, 1369.0], [1053.0, 1422.0], [201.0, 1422.0]]}, {"cls_id": 16, "label": "number", "score": 0.730010449886322, "coordinate": [612, 1478, 649, 1497], "order": 21, "polygon_points": [[612.0, 1478.0], [648.0, 1478.0], [648.0, 1496.0], [612.0, 1496.0]]}]}}, "markdown": {"text": "## 阳光——\n\n活出人性善良、美好的一面。\n\n## 勇敢——\n\n心底坦荡、正直、强烈的正义感，敢于面对、接受、敢于主动承担、有解决问题的信心和决心，为了善良和信念无谓生死，永不退缩！\n\n## 正义---\n\n传播和保护正能量，控制自己的邪恶，或在保护好自己的基础上，合理阻止他人的邪恶。从制度上保证每个人的人格、权益、尊严得到保护，不受伤害。\n\n## 博爱——\n\n基于平等与自由意志的普世价值，对自己、他人以及万事万物的生命，源于纯粹心灵无私、广泛、没有束缚的爱！博爱是在成熟文明的社会环境中每个公民应具备的基本品质。\n\n## 节制——\n\n保持理性，任何事都在健康合理的度以内调整。\n\n[08]\n\n## 戒恶：虚伪、无知、自私、自卑、贪婪、嫉妒、束缚、伤害\n\n## 恶——\n\n指人性中丑陋的、黑暗的一面，也包括由于奴性文化形成的让人们痛苦的、苦悲的诸多因素。\n\n## 戒恶——\n\n认知人性及奴性在生命中形成的无知、愚昧、迷失自我等的不成熟状态。懂得摒弃“恶”的习惯，理性、勇敢地接受并弱化或改变。对于本性的特质，做到清醒的自我认知和有效的节制，把“恶”管控在一定的范围内，尽量规避或最大化地降低对彼此造成的伤害或痛苦！与此同时，朝着“善”的一面发展，培养健全的人格，成就阳光个性的生命。\n\n## 虚伪——\n\n假的、不真实的、不真诚的，让人不信任的、让人痛苦的。\n\n## 无知——\n\n不善于思考、认知事物太局限、太狭隘，停留在自我的固定思维意识当中、缺乏开放性思维和不断学习的意识，形成自以为是、固执、骄傲或自怨自艾的状态。", "images": {}}, "outputImages": {"layout_det_res": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//79d2ad4e-3a32-454d-8d7a-9a9e54c26c36/layout_det_res_0.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T08%3A09%3A55Z%2F-1%2F%2F64892b20ed9f4cf5991362faf9e98c17629675d6e52b509339e501800b667a15"}, "inputImage": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//79d2ad4e-3a32-454d-8d7a-9a9e54c26c36/input_img_0.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T08%3A09%3A55Z%2F-1%2F%2Fe33640ff82c4c912b5717debe035d5b743c72643da45554547dcca539988d1f5"}], "dataInfo": {"numPages": 1, "pages": [{"width": 1190, "height": 1684}], "type": "pdf"}, "preprocessedImages": ["https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//79d2ad4e-3a32-454d-8d7a-9a9e54c26c36/preprocessed_img_0.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T08%3A09%3A55Z%2F-1%2F%2F52cc39c69bca9389c084717a4c1746b09b6d2c6bba72c0e1f39b2afab2819aab"]}, "errorCode": 0, "errorMsg": "Success"}
